<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-biological-renewable-resources> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#jeffReading> "'Focus is infrastructure' is this in practice — Jeff's finite attention is the resource every protocol and automation exists to conserve." <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-biological-renewable-resources> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#techReading> "Patterns, skills, hooks, memory — recurring value — over one-shot human effort. Invest in the pattern, not the individual fix. Treat Jeff's attention as the renewable-but-finite resource the whole system is designed to protect." <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-biological-renewable-resources> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#label> "Use biological and renewable resources" <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
