<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-mistakes-are-tools-for-learning> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Evaluate your trials. Making mistakes is a sign you're trying to do things better. There is usually little penalty for mistakes if you learn from them." <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
