<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-function-supported-by-multiple-elements> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#order> "5"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-function-supported-by-multiple-elements> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#source> "Hemenway, T. Gaia's Garden, 2nd ed., p. 6." <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-function-supported-by-multiple-elements> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#jeffReading> "Jeff shaped the three roles to be distinct, not interchangeable. Their different instincts are the asset; collapsing them to one voice would make the system fragile." <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-function-supported-by-multiple-elements> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#techReading> "Distinct role voices, multiple tests, multiple memory sources. Reduce-to-single is a lossy default. Three gates (product, code, arch) supporting the quality function via different lenses." <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-function-supported-by-multiple-elements> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#label> "Each function is supported by multiple elements" <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-function-supported-by-multiple-elements> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#comment> "Use multiple methods to achieve important functions and to create redundancy and backup. Redundancy protects when one or more elements fail." <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-function-supported-by-multiple-elements> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#ownedBy> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#principal-wren> <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-function-supported-by-multiple-elements> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#principal-wren> <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-function-supported-by-multiple-elements> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-10-08T16:13:43Z" <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-function-supported-by-multiple-elements> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Use multiple methods to achieve important functions and to create redundancy and backup. Redundancy protects when one or more elements fail." <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-function-supported-by-multiple-elements> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Each function is supported by multiple elements" <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
