<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-least-change-greatest-effect> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Understand the system you are working with well enough to find its 'leverage points' and intervene there, where the least work accomplishes the most change." <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-least-change-greatest-effect> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Make the least change for the greatest effect" <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
