<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-get-a-yield> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#order> "12"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-get-a-yield> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#source> "Hemenway, T. Gaia's Garden, 2nd ed., p. 7." <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-get-a-yield> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#jeffReading> "Jeff measures himself by what ships, not what he knows. The 'no dark work' principle is his." <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-get-a-yield> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#techReading> "Visible yield per card, per session. No dark work. The demo is the learning moment. Short-term: a shipped card. Long-term: a pattern the team can reuse." <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
